BEGIN refund_profile_a_sl_fd1_Success
Saved theorem _______ "refund_profile_a_sl_fd1_Success"
CHECKED refund_profile_a_sl_fd1_Success
⊢ ∀io.
    extract_fs no_ext (cl,fs) io =
    SOME
      (add_stdout (fastForwardFD fs 0)
         (refund_render_fields
            (refund_fields charge request original remaining enabled opened
               candidate amount reason))) ∧ STD_streams fs ⇒
    ∃t io'.
      Terminate Success io = Terminate t io' ∧
      (t = Success ∧
       fd1_written io' =
       explode
         (refund_render_fields
            (refund_fields charge request original remaining enabled opened
               candidate amount reason)) ∨
       t = Resource_limit_hit ∧
       fd1_written io' ≼
       explode
         (refund_render_fields
            (refund_fields charge request original remaining enabled opened
               candidate amount reason)))
END refund_profile_a_sl_fd1_Success 0.048 s
